        <mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;i&gt;Plan A, Plan B and Plan C are the plans of the Teaching approaches below. Teal: students work in the service; amber: the instructor shows it; gray: students use Desktop. A Pro license matters only for the version history of Exercise C.3, and a tenant setting beats a license. Before the term, test the second question with a student-licensed account: Step 2 and Step 7 of Tutorial C.1 and Step 3 of Tutorial C.3.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="446" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
